##### GasterPod  
*solo / duo* 

A humidity-stable 90 mm maze keeps edible snails active for stronger shells. Bio-film drip-feeds supply calcium and probiotics.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Snails – all 10 Balcony breeds  
